IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `re42-nouns`
IMPORT `re42-published-figures`
IMPORT `re42-s9-purchase-tax`

-- Row il-42. TESTS OF SECTION 9, written from the text of the Law and from the figures read off SH 5785 p. 151 and SH 5782 p. 460, never from the code.
-- Every expected value was worked by hand from the ladders printed in re42-published-figures.l4 (the arithmetic is shown beside each group of tests).
-- The two readings of the end of the (ג1ו) period are tested by name. A day with no figure in the sources is asserted as NOTHING.

§ `Tests of section 9`

§§ `Builders`

GIVEN who IS A `Who holds a dwelling`
      share IS A NUMBER
      inherited IS A BOOLEAN
      protected IS A BOOLEAN
      inIsrael IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A dwelling held by someone`
`another dwelling` MEANS
    `A dwelling held by someone` WITH
        `held by` IS who
        `the share of it that you and those treated as one buyer with you hold together, as a fraction of the whole` IS share
        `it came to the holder by inheritance` IS inherited
        `it was let under a protected tenancy before 1 January 1997` IS protected
        `it lies in Israel or in the Area` IS inIsrael

GIVEN day IS A DATE
      value IS A NUMBER
      individual IS A BOOLEAN
      resident IS A BOOLEAN
      others IS A LIST OF `A dwelling held by someone`
      former IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `A purchase of a dwelling`
`a purchase` MEANS
    `A purchase of a dwelling` WITH
        `the day of the purchase` IS day
        `the value of the right you bought` IS value
        `you are an individual` IS individual
        `you are an Israeli resident` IS resident
        `within two years of the purchase you became an Israeli resident for the first time or a returning long-term resident` IS FALSE
        `you are a member of a purchase group for the dwelling` IS FALSE
        `the sale value of the built dwelling` IS 0
        `your other dwellings` IS others
        `the months from the purchase to the day you sold the dwelling that was your only dwelling until the purchase, if you did` IS former
        `you bought from a contractor` IS FALSE
        `the months from the day possession was due under the contract to that sale, if you sold` IS NOTHING
        `possession was late for reasons outside your control` IS FALSE
        `the months from the day possession was actually given to that sale, if you sold` IS NOTHING
        `the dwelling is an alternative dwelling under the one-off exemption` IS FALSE
        `your earlier purchase in a purchase group, if you made one` IS NOTHING

GIVETH A LIST OF `A dwelling held by someone`
`no other dwelling` MEANS EMPTY

GIVEN day IS A DATE, value IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A purchase of a dwelling`
`a resident individual with no other dwelling, buying on` MEANS
    `a purchase` day value TRUE TRUE `no other dwelling` NOTHING

§§ `The arithmetic of a ladder: both sides of every step edge`

-- (ג1ג)(3) as from 1 January 2025: 0% to 1,978,745; 3.5% to 2,347,040; 5% to 6,055,070; 8% to 20,183,565; 10% above. Worked by hand:
--   at 1,978,745: 0; at 1,978,746: 0.035; at 2,347,040: 0.035 x 368,295 = 12,890.325; at 3,000,000: 12,890.325 + 0.05 x 652,960 = 45,538.325;
--   at 6,055,070: 12,890.325 + 0.05 x 3,708,030 = 198,291.825; at 20,183,565: 198,291.825 + 0.08 x 14,128,495 = 1,328,571.425; at 21,183,565: + 100,000 = 1,428,571.425.
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 1_978_745 (`the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 1_978_746 (`the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 0.035
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 2_347_040 (`the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 12_890.325
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 3_000_000 (`the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 45_538.325
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 6_055_070 (`the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 198_291.825
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 20_183_565 (`the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 1_328_571.425
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 21_183_565 (`the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(3) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 1_428_571.425

-- (ג1ג)(1) as from 1 January 2025: 5% to 1,465,800; 6% to 4,397,380; 7% to 6,055,070; 8% to 20,183,565; 10% above. By hand:
--   at 1,465,800: 73,290; at 4,397,380: 73,290 + 0.06 x 2,931,580 = 249,184.8; at 6,055,070: 249,184.8 + 0.07 x 1,657,690 = 365,223.1; at 20,183,565: 365,223.1 + 1,130,279.6 = 1,495,502.7.
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 1_465_800 (`the general ladder of (ג1ג)(1) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 73_290
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 4_397_380 (`the general ladder of (ג1ג)(1) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 249_184.8
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 6_055_070 (`the general ladder of (ג1ג)(1) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 365_223.1
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 20_183_565 (`the general ladder of (ג1ג)(1) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 1_495_502.7
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 7_000_000 (`the general ladder of (ג1ג)(1) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 440_817.5

-- (ג1ו)(1): 8% to the amount, 10% above. By hand: 8% of 6,055,070 = 484,405.6; at 7,000,000: 484,405.6 + 0.10 x 944,930 = 578,898.6.
--   As first enacted: 8% of 5,348,565 = 427,885.2; at 6,000,000: 427,885.2 + 0.10 x 651,435 = 493,028.7.
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 6_055_070 (`the temporary ladder of (ג1ו)(1) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 484_405.6
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 7_000_000 (`the temporary ladder of (ג1ו)(1) as from 1 January 2025`) EQUALS 578_898.6
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 5_348_565 (`the temporary ladder of (ג1ו)(1) as first enacted`) EQUALS 427_885.2
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 6_000_000 (`the temporary ladder of (ג1ו)(1) as first enacted`) EQUALS 493_028.7

-- (ג1ב), 6 May to 31 July 2013 (printed amounts). By hand: general: 5% x 1,089,350 = 54,467.5; at 3,268,040: 54,467.5 + 0.06 x 2,178,690 = 185,188.9; at 4,000,000: + 0.07 x 731,960 = 236,426.1.
--   Single dwelling: 0 to 1,470,560; 3.5% x 273,710 = 9,579.85 at 1,744,270; at 2,000,000: 9,579.85 + 0.05 x 255,730 = 22,366.35.
