#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 3_268_040 (`the transitional general ladder of (ג1ב)(1) as printed`) EQUALS 185_188.9
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 4_000_000 (`the transitional general ladder of (ג1ב)(1) as printed`) EQUALS 236_426.1
