--   (ג1א)(1): 3.5% x 969,330 = 33,926.55; at 1,000,000: + 5% x 30,670 = 1,533.5 -> 35,460.05.   (ג1א)(2)(א): 0 to 1,139,320; at 1,601,210: 0.035 x 461,890 = 16,166.15.
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 385_060 (`the ladder of (ג) as printed`) EQUALS 1_925.3
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 597_640 (`the ladder of (ג) as printed`) EQUALS 9_365.6
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 700_000 (`the ladder of (ג) as printed`) EQUALS 13_971.8
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 969_330 (`the ladder of (ג1א)(1) as printed`) EQUALS 33_926.55
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 1_000_000 (`the ladder of (ג1א)(1) as printed`) EQUALS 35_460.05
#ASSERT `the tax on a value under a ladder` 1_601_210 (`the ladder of (ג1א)(2)(א) as printed`) EQUALS 16_166.15

