§§ `A buyer who is not within (ג1ג)(2): the general ladder and the temporary ladder`

-- A company, or an individual with another dwelling. 7 million shekels. General ladder: 440,817.5. Temporary: 578,898.6 (2025 amounts) or, as first enacted, 8% x 5,348,565 + 10% x 1,651,435 = 427,885.2 + 165,143.5 = 593,028.7.
GIVEN day IS A DATE, value IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A purchase of a dwelling`
`a company buying on` MEANS
    `a purchase` day value FALSE FALSE `no other dwelling` NOTHING

-- 28 November 2021 to 15 January 2022: the amount as first enacted, read from the official page.
#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`a company buying on` (Date 28 11 2021) 7_000_000) `the end declined: answer only where the readings agree` EQUALS JUST 593_028.7
