§§ `The routes into the single-dwelling ladder of (ג1ג)(2)`

-- 3 million on 1 January 2025, single-dwelling ladder of 2025: 45,538.325 (worked above). A general-ladder buyer at 3 million: 249,184.8 would need 4,397,380; at 3 million:
--   73,290 + 0.06 x (3,000,000 - 1,465,800 = 1,534,200) = 73,290 + 92,052 = 165,342.
`the reading of the day` MEANS `the end printed in the Law, 31 December 2024`

`a spouse living with you holds the whole of a dwelling` MEANS
    LIST (`another dwelling` `your spouse, living with you` 1 FALSE FALSE TRUE)

-- (א) the only dwelling.
#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`a purchase` (Date 1 1 2025) 3_000_000 TRUE TRUE `no other dwelling` NOTHING) (`the reading of the day`) EQUALS JUST 45_538.325
-- Another dwelling that counts, nothing else: not within (ג1ג)(2); the general ladder (the printed reading: the temporary rule is over).
#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`a purchase` (Date 1 1 2025) 3_000_000 TRUE TRUE (`a spouse living with you holds the whole of a dwelling`) NOTHING) (`the reading of the day`) EQUALS JUST 165_342
-- A dwelling held by someone else does not count.
#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`a purchase` (Date 1 1 2025) 3_000_000 TRUE TRUE (LIST (`another dwelling` `someone else` 1 FALSE FALSE TRUE)) NOTHING) (`the reading of the day`) EQUALS JUST 45_538.325
-- Not an individual, or not resident: not within (ג1ג)(2).
#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`a purchase` (Date 1 1 2025) 3_000_000 FALSE TRUE `no other dwelling` NOTHING) (`the reading of the day`) EQUALS JUST 165_342
#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`a purchase` (Date 1 1 2025) 3_000_000 TRUE FALSE `no other dwelling` NOTHING) (`the reading of the day`) EQUALS JUST 165_342
-- (ב) sold the former only dwelling after the purchase: within 24 months, and not after; but for a purchase on 1 January 2025 the 18-month reading of Amendment 102 is in force (to 31 May 2025), so 18 months.
#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`a purchase` (Date 1 1 2025) 3_000_000 TRUE TRUE (`a spouse living with you holds the whole of a dwelling`) (JUST 18)) (`the reading of the day`) EQUALS JUST 45_538.325
#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`a purchase` (Date 1 1 2025) 3_000_000 TRUE TRUE (`a spouse living with you holds the whole of a dwelling`) (JUST 19)) (`the reading of the day`) EQUALS JUST 165_342
#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`a purchase` (Date 1 1 2025) 3_000_000 TRUE TRUE (`a spouse living with you holds the whole of a dwelling`) (JUST 0)) (`the reading of the day`) EQUALS JUST 45_538.325
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a purchase` (Date 1 1 2025) 3_000_000 TRUE TRUE `no other dwelling` NOTHING) EQUALS FALSE

§§ `The sale-in-time clock for a purchase from a contractor`

GIVEN dueMonths IS A MAYBE NUMBER, late IS A BOOLEAN, actualMonths IS A MAYBE NUMBER, ordinaryMonths IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `A purchase of a dwelling`
`a contractor purchase` MEANS
    `A purchase of a dwelling` WITH
        `the day of the purchase` IS Date 1 1 2025
        `the value of the right you bought` IS 3_000_000
        `you are an individual` IS TRUE
        `you are an Israeli resident` IS TRUE
        `within two years of the purchase you became an Israeli resident for the first time or a returning long-term resident` IS FALSE
        `you are a member of a purchase group for the dwelling` IS FALSE
        `the sale value of the built dwelling` IS 0
        `your other dwellings` IS `a spouse living with you holds the whole of a dwelling`
        `the months from the purchase to the day you sold the dwelling that was your only dwelling until the purchase, if you did` IS ordinaryMonths
        `you bought from a contractor` IS TRUE
        `the months from the day possession was due under the contract to that sale, if you sold` IS dueMonths
        `possession was late for reasons outside your control` IS late
        `the months from the day possession was actually given to that sale, if you sold` IS actualMonths
        `the dwelling is an alternative dwelling under the one-off exemption` IS FALSE
        `your earlier purchase in a purchase group, if you made one` IS NOTHING

-- From a contractor, possession on time: 12 months from the due day, not the 24 months of an ordinary purchase.
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a contractor purchase` (JUST 12) FALSE NOTHING (JUST 13)) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a contractor purchase` (JUST 13) FALSE NOTHING (JUST 5)) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a contractor purchase` NOTHING FALSE NOTHING (JUST 5)) EQUALS FALSE
-- From a contractor, possession late for reasons outside the buyer's control: 12 months from the day possession was actually given.
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a contractor purchase` (JUST 20) TRUE (JUST 12) NOTHING) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a contractor purchase` (JUST 5) TRUE (JUST 13) NOTHING) EQUALS FALSE

§§ `The 18-month reading of Amendment 102 (a purchase from 1 June 2023 to 31 May 2025)`

-- "Within 24 months after the purchase" reads "within 18 months" for a dwelling bought on or after 1 June 2023, during two years from that day (SH 5783 p. 161, s 10).
GIVEN day IS A DATE, former IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `A purchase of a dwelling`
`a purchase that replaced a dwelling, on` MEANS
    `a purchase` day 3_000_000 TRUE TRUE (`a spouse living with you holds the whole of a dwelling`) former

#ASSERT `the months within which the former only dwelling must be sold, for an ordinary purchase` (Date 31 5 2023) EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `the months within which the former only dwelling must be sold, for an ordinary purchase` (Date 1 6 2023) EQUALS 18
#ASSERT `the months within which the former only dwelling must be sold, for an ordinary purchase` (Date 31 5 2025) EQUALS 18
#ASSERT `the months within which the former only dwelling must be sold, for an ordinary purchase` (Date 1 6 2025) EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a purchase that replaced a dwelling, on` (Date 31 5 2023) (JUST 24)) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a purchase that replaced a dwelling, on` (Date 1 6 2023) (JUST 24)) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a purchase that replaced a dwelling, on` (Date 1 6 2023) (JUST 19)) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a purchase that replaced a dwelling, on` (Date 1 6 2023) (JUST 18)) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a purchase that replaced a dwelling, on` (Date 31 5 2025) (JUST 19)) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a purchase that replaced a dwelling, on` (Date 1 6 2025) (JUST 24)) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `you sold your former only dwelling in time` (`a purchase that replaced a dwelling, on` (Date 1 6 2025) (JUST 25)) EQUALS FALSE
-- The price of the same facts: a purchase of 1 June 2023 with the former dwelling sold in month 20 loses the single-dwelling ladder; the reading of the end of the (ג1ו) period is irrelevant before 2025.
--   (2023 single-dwelling ladder, 3,000,000: 3.5% x (2,276,360 - 1,919,155 = 357,205) = 12,502.175; 5% x (3,000,000 - 2,276,360 = 723,640) = 36,182 -> 48,684.175; no figure at all for the general ladder on that day: NOTHING.)
#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`a purchase that replaced a dwelling, on` (Date 31 5 2023) (JUST 20)) (`the end declined: answer only where the readings agree`) EQUALS JUST 48_684.175
#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`a purchase that replaced a dwelling, on` (Date 1 6 2023) (JUST 20)) (`the end declined: answer only where the readings agree`) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `A member of a purchase group is taxed on the built dwelling`

`a group member` MEANS
    `A purchase of a dwelling` WITH
        `the day of the purchase` IS Date 1 1 2025
        `the value of the right you bought` IS 3_000_000
        `you are an individual` IS TRUE
        `you are an Israeli resident` IS TRUE
        `within two years of the purchase you became an Israeli resident for the first time or a returning long-term resident` IS FALSE
        `you are a member of a purchase group for the dwelling` IS TRUE
        `the sale value of the built dwelling` IS 4_000_000
        `your other dwellings` IS `no other dwelling`
        `the months from the purchase to the day you sold the dwelling that was your only dwelling until the purchase, if you did` IS NOTHING
        `you bought from a contractor` IS FALSE
        `the months from the day possession was due under the contract to that sale, if you sold` IS NOTHING
        `possession was late for reasons outside your control` IS FALSE
        `the months from the day possession was actually given to that sale, if you sold` IS NOTHING
        `the dwelling is an alternative dwelling under the one-off exemption` IS FALSE
        `your earlier purchase in a purchase group, if you made one` IS NOTHING

-- At 4,000,000 under the 2025 single-dwelling ladder: 12,890.325 + 0.05 x (4,000,000 - 2,347,040 = 1,652,960) = 12,890.325 + 82,648 = 95,538.325.
#ASSERT `the value your tax is charged on` (`a group member`) EQUALS 4_000_000
#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`a group member`) (`the reading of the day`) EQUALS JUST 95_538.325

§§ `The resident who became resident within two years, and the group-dwelling route`

`resident only within two years` MEANS
    `A purchase of a dwelling` WITH
        `the day of the purchase` IS Date 1 1 2025
        `the value of the right you bought` IS 3_000_000
        `you are an individual` IS TRUE
        `you are an Israeli resident` IS FALSE
        `within two years of the purchase you became an Israeli resident for the first time or a returning long-term resident` IS TRUE
        `you are a member of a purchase group for the dwelling` IS FALSE
        `the sale value of the built dwelling` IS 0
        `your other dwellings` IS `no other dwelling`
        `the months from the purchase to the day you sold the dwelling that was your only dwelling until the purchase, if you did` IS NOTHING
        `you bought from a contractor` IS FALSE
        `the months from the day possession was due under the contract to that sale, if you sold` IS NOTHING
        `possession was late for reasons outside your control` IS FALSE
        `the months from the day possession was actually given to that sale, if you sold` IS NOTHING
        `the dwelling is an alternative dwelling under the one-off exemption` IS FALSE
        `your earlier purchase in a purchase group, if you made one` IS NOTHING

#ASSERT `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` (`resident only within two years`) (`the reading of the day`) EQUALS JUST 45_538.325

GIVEN years IS A NUMBER, building IS A BOOLEAN, possession IS A BOOLEAN, sold18 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `An earlier purchase in a purchase group`
`an earlier group purchase` MEANS
    `An earlier purchase in a purchase group` WITH
        `that group dwelling was your only dwelling when you bought it` IS TRUE
        `the years from that purchase to this one` IS years
        `building of the group dwelling had not begun in that time, or the Director is satisfied that another material delay occurred` IS building
        `possession of the group dwelling had not been given to you in that time` IS possession
        `the delay was outside your control and not known when you bought the group dwelling` IS TRUE
        `you sold the group dwelling within 18 months of the completion of its building` IS sold18
        `but for the group dwelling the dwelling you now buy would be your only dwelling` IS TRUE

-- (ב1): four years if building had not begun (or another material delay); six and a half years if possession was not given; and the sale within 18 months of completion.
